盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 67.8%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.33"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":69.08,"default_fair_val":69.08,"premium_pct":-45.1,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":1819.3,"pe_forward":1601,"pb_trailing":32.4,"pb_forward":29.2,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":7.8,"fcf_to_ev":3.47,"fcf_to_mcap":3.21,"liab_to_assets":67.8,"cash_to_assets":49.6,"current_ratio":1.33,"roe":1.8,"roa":0.4,"moat":{"ticker":"SYM","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Symbotic 的品牌定價權相對有限。其核心業務為自動化倉儲系統，客戶主要為大型零售商和批發商，這些客戶對成本敏感度高，議價能力強。雖然 Symbotic 的技術領先，但其產品並非必需品，客戶有潛在的替代方案，且品牌忠誠度並非其主要競爭優勢。公司需持續透過技術創新和服務來鞏固客戶關係，而非依賴品牌溢價。目前來看，其品牌尚未形成強大的定價壁壘，分數為中等。","comment_en":"Symbotic's brand pricing power is relatively limited. Its core business is automated warehousing systems, and its main customers are large retailers and wholesalers who are highly cost-sensitive and possess strong bargaining power. Although Symbotic's technology is leading, its products are not necessities, and customers have potential alternative solutions, with brand loyalty not being its primary competitive advantage. The company needs to continuously consolidate customer relationships through technological innovation and services, rather than relying on brand premiums. Currently, its brand has not formed a strong pricing barrier, hence the moderate score."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Symbotic 在自動化倉儲領域擁有關鍵的技術專利，特別是在機器人、軟體和系統整合方面。這些專利構成了重要的進入壁壘，使其競爭對手難以複製其核心技術和解決方案。雖然自動化倉儲行業的監管相對寬鬆，但技術專利是 Symbotic 最顯著的無形資產。公司持續投入研發，不斷擴充專利組合，這有助於維持其技術領先地位，並在一定程度上保護其市場份額免受侵蝕。分數為堅固。","comment_en":"Symbotic holds key technology patents in the field of automated warehousing, particularly in robotics, software, and system integration. These patents form significant entry barriers, making it difficult for competitors to replicate its core technologies and solutions. While the automation warehousing industry has relatively loose regulations, technology patents are Symbotic's most notable intangible assets. The company continuously invests in R&D, expanding its patent portfolio, which helps maintain its technological leadership and, to some extent, protects its market share from erosion. The score is solid."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Symbotic 的自動化倉儲系統具有顯著的轉換成本。一旦客戶導入 Symbotic 的系統，將涉及大量的初始投資、系統整合、員工培訓以及營運流程的改變。更重要的是，這些系統與客戶的供應鏈和庫存管理深度綁定，更換供應商不僅成本高昂，還可能導致嚴重的營運中斷。這種深度整合和營運依賴性，為 Symbotic 創造了強大的客戶黏性，使其客戶難以轉向競爭對手。分數為堅固。","comment_en":"Symbotic's automated warehousing systems entail significant switching costs. Once a customer implements Symbotic's system, it involves substantial initial investment, system integration, employee training, and changes to operational processes. More importantly, these systems are deeply integrated with the customer's supply chain and inventory management. Switching vendors is not only costly but can also lead to severe operational disruptions. This deep integration and operational dependency create strong customer stickiness for Symbotic, making it difficult for clients to switch to competitors. The score is solid."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Symbotic 的業務模式目前尚未顯現出明顯的網絡效應。其自動化倉儲系統主要為單一客戶提供服務，其價值主要取決於系統本身的效率和技術，而非用戶之間的互動。雖然公司可能透過與供應商建立合作關係來優化其供應鏈效率，但這並非典型的網絡效應，即用戶數量的增加直接提升了產品或服務的價值。因此，在網絡效應方面，Symbotic 的壁壘非常薄弱。","comment_en":"Symbotic's business model does not currently exhibit significant network effects. Its automated warehousing systems primarily serve individual clients, and their value depends mainly on the efficiency and technology of the system itself, rather than user interactions. While the company might optimize its supply chain efficiency through partnerships with suppliers, this is not a typical network effect where an increase in user numbers directly enhances the value of the product or service. Therefore, Symbotic's barrier in terms of network effects is very weak."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Symbotic 受益於其在自動化倉儲解決方案領域的規模經濟效應。隨著公司業務的擴張和訂單量的增加，其在採購、生產和研發方面的成本攤薄效應日益顯著。大規模的部署和標準化組件的使用，有助於降低單位成本。此外，公司透過與供應商建立長期合作關係，可能獲得更優惠的採購價格。這種規模帶來的成本優勢，使其在與較小競爭者競爭時更具價格彈性，並能提供更具吸引力的解決方案。分數為堅固。","comment_en":"Symbotic benefits from economies of scale in the field of automated warehousing solutions. As the company's business expands and order volumes increase, the cost-averaging effect in procurement, production, and R&D becomes increasingly significant. Large-scale deployment and the use of standardized components help reduce unit costs. Furthermore, by establishing long-term cooperative relationships with suppliers, the company may obtain more favorable procurement prices. This scale-driven cost advantage gives it greater pricing flexibility when competing with smaller players and allows it to offer more attractive solutions. The score is solid."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Symbotic 的業務模式並未依賴於獨特的地理位置或特定資產。其自動化倉儲系統是可部署於全球任何符合條件的設施中。雖然客戶的地理位置可能影響物流效率，但 Symbotic 本身並不擁有或依賴任何特定的、難以複製的地理資產來構建其競爭優勢。其核心價值在於技術和系統整合能力，而非地理上的獨特性。因此，在此維度上，其護城河非常薄弱。","comment_en":"Symbotic's business model does not rely on unique geographical locations or specific assets. Its automated warehousing systems can be deployed in any suitable facility worldwide. While the geographical location of customers might affect logistics efficiency, Symbotic itself does not own or depend on any specific, irreplicable geographical assets to build its competitive advantage. Its core value lies in its technology and system integration capabilities, not geographical uniqueness. Therefore, its moat in this dimension is very weak."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Symbotic 在營運效率方面表現出色，這構成了其重要的競爭壁壘。公司專注於提供高度自動化和優化的倉儲解決方案，能夠顯著提高客戶的庫存周轉率、訂單處理速度和準確性，同時降低勞動力成本和出錯率。其系統的設計和持續的技術迭代，旨在最大化營運效率。這種卓越的營運能力，使其能夠為客戶創造實質性的價值，並在市場中脫穎而出。分數為堅固。","comment_en":"Symbotic demonstrates outstanding operational efficiency, which constitutes a significant competitive barrier. The company focuses on providing highly automated and optimized warehousing solutions, capable of significantly improving customers' inventory turnover rates, order processing speed, and accuracy, while reducing labor costs and error rates. The design of its systems and continuous technological iteration aim to maximize operational efficiency. This superior operational capability allows it to create substantial value for its customers and stand out in the market. The score is solid."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Symbotic 的資本配置策略顯示出其對長期價值的關注。公司擁有強勁的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $737.3M）和健康的資產負債表（現金 $1,746.4M / 負債 $25.8M），這為其提供了充足的資源來支持研發投入、擴大產能以及戰略性收購。管理層似乎能夠明智地將資本投入到能夠產生高額回報的領域，例如持續的技術創新和市場擴張。其對核心業務的專注和對股東價值的長期承諾，體現了良好的資本配置能力。分數為堅固。","comment_en":"Symbotic's capital allocation strategy reflects a focus on long-term value. The company possesses strong free cash flow (FCF TTM: $737.3M) and a healthy balance sheet (Cash $1,746.4M / Debt $25.8M), providing ample resources to support R&D investments, capacity expansion, and strategic acquisitions. Management appears capable of wisely allocating capital to areas generating high returns, such as continuous technological innovation and market expansion. Its focus on the core business and commitment to long-term shareholder value demonstrate good capital allocation capabilities. The score is solid."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Symbotic 透過其高度整合的自動化倉儲解決方案，實現了極高的客戶留存率。如 M3 所述，系統的深度整合和高昂的轉換成本是主要原因。一旦客戶依賴 Symbotic 的系統來管理其關鍵的供應鏈和庫存運營，他們就極少會尋求替代方案。此外，Symbotic 持續的技術升級和優質的客戶服務，進一步鞏固了客戶關係。這種強大的客戶黏性，為公司帶來了穩定且可預測的收入流，是其堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"Symbotic achieves extremely high customer retention rates through its highly integrated automated warehousing solutions. As mentioned in M3, the deep system integration and high switching costs are the primary reasons. Once customers rely on Symbotic's systems to manage their critical supply chain and inventory operations, they are very unlikely to seek alternatives. Furthermore, Symbotic's continuous technological upgrades and quality customer service further solidify customer relationships. This strong customer stickiness provides the company with a stable and predictable revenue stream, forming its solid moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Symbotic 的業務具有相當的持久性，主要得益於其技術壁壘和客戶的高度依賴性。自動化倉儲是現代物流和供應鏈的關鍵組成部分，隨著電子商務的發展和對效率要求的提高，其需求將持續增長。Symbotic 的專利技術和已建立的客戶關係，使其能夠抵禦短期市場波動和新進入者的挑戰。雖然技術變革是該行業的常態，但 Symbotic 持續的研發投入和對核心競爭力的鞏固，有助於維持其長期競爭優勢。分數為堅固。","comment_en":"Symbotic's business possesses considerable durability, primarily due to its technological barriers and high customer dependency. Automated warehousing is a critical component of modern logistics and supply chains, and its demand will continue to grow with the development of e-commerce and increasing efficiency requirements. Symbotic's patented technology and established customer relationships enable it to withstand short-term market fluctuations and challenges from new entrants. While technological change is common in this industry, Symbotic's continuous R&D investment and strengthening of core competencies help maintain its long-term competitive advantage. The score is solid."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Symbotic 在自動化倉儲領域展現了強勁的競爭優勢，其護城河主要體現在高轉換成本（M3）和卓越的營運效率（M7）上，這造就了極高的客戶留存率（M9）。公司透過技術專利（M2）和規模經濟（M5）進一步鞏固了其市場地位。儘管品牌定價權（M1）和網絡效應（M4）相對薄弱，且不依賴獨特地理資產（M6），但其核心業務的持久性（M10）和良好的資本配置（M8）使其成為一個具有長期潛力的投資標的。整體而言，Symbotic 擁有類似於「收費橋」的商業模式，客戶一旦深度整合，便難以離開，為公司帶來穩定的現金流。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Symbotic demonstrates strong competitive advantages in the automated warehousing sector. Its moat is primarily reflected in high switching costs (M3) and excellent operational efficiency (M7), which result in extremely high customer retention rates (M9). The company further solidifies its market position through technology patents (M2) and economies of scale (M5). Although brand pricing power (M1) and network effects (M4) are relatively weak, and it does not rely on unique geographical assets (M6), the durability of its core business (M10) and sound capital allocation (M8) make it an investment with long-term potential. Overall, Symbotic possesses a business model akin to a 'toll bridge,' where once customers are deeply integrated, it is difficult for them to leave, providing the company with stable cash flows.","evidenceHash":"43966bd05e03021d4a07a41b19ec148a788b513860b31f89df904434820524be","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-09-27","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T04:13:44.204Z","evidenceHash":"01780a0287eafc21550597b404f3f9f49b35ad7f3611c0093cdb29a63b06a2f9"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-09-27","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T04:13:44.204Z","evidenceHash":"01780a0287eafc21550597b404f3f9f49b35ad7f3611c0093cdb29a63b06a2f9"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SYM.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SYM.png","website":"https://www.symbotic.com","ceo":"Richard Cohen","full_time_employees":"2000","description":"Symbotic Inc. is a company specializing in automation solutions, offering cutting-edge robotics and technology designed to boost operational efficiency for wholesale and retail businesses across the United States. They provide a comprehensive automated warehousing solution called The Symbotic System, which is engineered to lower expenditures, increase productivity, and streamline inventory control. The firm's headquarters are situated in Wilmington, Massachusetts.","description_en":"Symbotic Inc. is a company specializing in automation solutions, offering cutting-edge robotics and technology designed to boost operational efficiency for wholesale and retail businesses across the United States. They provide a comprehensive automated warehousing solution called The Symbotic System, which is engineered to lower expenditures, increase productivity, and streamline inventory control. The firm's headquarters are situated in Wilmington, Massachusetts.","description_zh":"Symbotic Inc.（美股代碼：SYM）為 Industrials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Industrial - Machinery 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"200 Research Drive","city":"Wilmington","state":"MA","zip":"01887","country":"US","phone":"978 284 2800","full_address":"200 Research Drive, Wilmington, MA 01887, US","range_52w":"36.0205-87.88","year_high":87.88,"year_low":36.0205,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":36.0205,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-28","name":"Martins Izilda P","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":7224,"price":38.93,"total_val":0.28},{"date":"2026-10-28","name":"Kuffner James","title":"officer: Chief Technology Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":19201,"price":38.24,"total_val":0.73},{"date":"2026-10-28","name":"Kuffner James","title":"officer: Chief Technology Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":198,"price":38.34,"total_val":0.01},{"date":"2026-10-28","name":"Alexander Brian Daniel","title":"officer: SVP, Commercial","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":9225,"price":38.26,"total_val":0.35},{"date":"2026-10-28","name":"Alexander Brian Daniel","title":"officer: SVP, Commerc